plex-bridge

The project owner authorized MIT distribution of this original application.
Playback and topology implementations were extracted from the owner's earlier
local bridge services. The public export does not include that installation's
Git history, inventories, operational scripts, or private state.

No vendored third-party application libraries or copied license notices were
identified in the reviewed source. Runtime imports use Python's standard
library. Protocol interoperability uses Plex and WiiM/LinkPlay interfaces;
this is not an official Plex or WiiM product.

The Docker base includes Python and Alpine Linux packages, which retain their
own licenses. The application MIT license does not replace those licenses.
Retain base-image notices and generate a software bill of materials when
publishing images. Build/test/security tools are separate dependencies and
retain their respective licenses. This source inspection is not a legal audit
of every historical contribution.
